OL,3,CFlagship Isle of Man 'Manxman' ferry
OL,4,Cout of service until late September
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's flagship ferry will
OL,7,Fnot return to service until late
OL,8,FSeptember 2026 due to "complex
OL,9,Frepairs".
OL,11,FThe Steam Packet Company (SPC) say the
OL,12,F'Manxman' was taken to dry dock for
OL,13,Fscheduled maintenance, but further
OL,14,Finspections found repairs are needed
OL,15,Fbefore it returns to service.
OL,17,FThe ferry usually operates the route
OL,18,Fbetween Douglas and Heysham, carrying
OL,19,Fpassengers and freight.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
