PN,36602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785383016
OL,3,CFlagship Isle of Man 'Manxman' ferry
OL,4,Cout of service until late September
OL,6,FIt entered the River Mersey to dry
OL,7,Fdock at Cammell Laird in Birkenhead on
OL,8,F15 July, and has remained there since.
OL,10,FEngineers identified areas of wear on
OL,11,Fpropulsion shaft bearings,
OL,12,Fhighlighting complex work required,
OL,13,Fwith specialist parts needed to be
OL,14,Fshipped in to make repairs.
OL,16,FManaging Director Brian Thomson said:
OL,17,F"We recognise this news will be
OL,18,Ffrustrating for many of our customers
OL,19,Fand we apologise for the inconvenience
OL,20,Fcaused.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785383016
OL,3,CFlagship Isle of Man 'Manxman' ferry
OL,4,Cout of service until late September
OL,6,F"Extending the dry dock is necessary
OL,7,Ffor safety and operational
OL,8,Freliability. Completing these
OL,9,Fadditional works now will ensure the
OL,10,Fvessel can continue to provide a
OL,11,Freliable and dependable service in the
OL,12,Fyears ahead."
OL,14,FA spokesperson from the SPC says the
OL,15,FBen-my-Chree ferry will continue to
OL,16,Foperate all Heysham sailings, while
OL,17,F'Arrow' has arrived on the island to
OL,18,Fprovide additional support for freight
OL,19,Fservices to and from the UK.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
