OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785383016
OL,3,CFlagship Isle of Man 'Manxman' ferry
OL,4,Cout of service until late September
OL,6,FInvestigations are continuing into the
OL,7,Fcause of the damage to the boat's
OL,8,Fshaft bearings.
OL,10,FThe SPC Reservations Team say they
OL,11,Fwill work closely with customers
OL,12,Faffected by vessel changes, or any
OL,13,Fnecessary cancellations as a result of
OL,14,FManxman's delayed return to service.
OL,16,FWant more on the issues effecting the
OL,17,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,18,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,19,Four region.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
